{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/MCBanner.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Explore unique worlds filled with threats, puzzles and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Help, save and clash with past versions of yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Unravel the mystery behind two gods and a half at war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Face the consequences of your actions with alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Experience beautiful hand-drawn cutscenes and a diverse, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Answer the question... <i>can you really trust your self</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle1.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/7-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wandering soul finds themselves lost in an eerie dreamscape filled with familiar yet discomforting wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can they come back to reality, or be doomed into torment by the creatures wandering galleries, theatres and gardens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sprawling world of nostalgia that seems a bit too dark, abandoned, and almost inhuman...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle2.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our protagonist isn't alone. Defying all logic, their younger self also finds themselves wandering the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not everyone should trust themselves, for this mirror image poses as no friend, tripping up our hero at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This begs the question, if there is another &quot;self&quot;... could there be many more?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle3.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A supposed goddess guides our lost lamb and promises an escape, in an exchange for becoming her vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her memories are gone and powers extinguished, but in spite of that, she can offer some words and encouragement to navigating her ruined land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...Just don't ask her about her wedding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle4.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/ezgif.com-crop__1_.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new world means new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay attentive and you might find something just as new to uncover, and perhaps understand the reason behind the lost soul's being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Lest, you too become lost between the line of fantasy and reality...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/SteamBanner3.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>PSYCHExFUSE</strong></i> will be a 3-part saga, with <i><strong>Part 1: L.C.D</strong></i> launching as an Early Access Title in late 2025. The remaining parts will be released as free updates as they are completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922140?t=1744736385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922140?t=1744736385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/dab9cff554fc9a037c9c97474a1a357e481b50dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744736385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/dab9cff554fc9a037c9c97474a1a357e481b50dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744736385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains some strong language, mild violence."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3382420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/MCBanner.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Explore unique worlds filled with threats, puzzles and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Help, save and clash with past versions of yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Unravel the mystery behind two gods and a half at war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Face the consequences of your actions with alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Experience beautiful hand-drawn cutscenes and a diverse, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Answer the question... <i>can you really trust your self</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle1.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/7-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wandering soul finds themselves lost in an eerie dreamscape filled with familiar yet discomforting wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can they come back to reality, or be doomed into torment by the creatures wandering galleries, theatres and gardens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sprawling world of nostalgia that seems a bit too dark, abandoned, and almost inhuman...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle2.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our protagonist isn't alone. Defying all logic, their younger self also finds themselves wandering the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not everyone should trust themselves, for this mirror image poses as no friend, tripping up our hero at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This begs the question, if there is another &quot;self&quot;... could there be many more?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle3.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A supposed goddess guides our lost lamb and promises an escape, in an exchange for becoming her vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her memories are gone and powers extinguished, but in spite of that, she can offer some words and encouragement to navigating her ruined land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...Just don't ask her about her wedding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/itchtitle4.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/ezgif.com-crop__1_.gif?t=1744736385\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new world means new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay attentive and you might find something just as new to uncover, and perhaps understand the reason behind the lost soul's being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Lest, you too become lost between the line of fantasy and reality...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/SteamBanner3.png?t=1744736385\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>PSYCHExFUSE</strong></i> will be a 3-part saga, with <i><strong>Part 1: L.C.D</strong></i> launching as an Early Access Title in late 2025. The remaining parts will be released as free updates as they are completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sewing with Daydreams"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/c05c33e23a11dea117c9e19c5030e227ff912959/header.jpg?t=1744736385","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107900,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107900/movie480.mp4?t=1740665038","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107900/movie_max.mp4?t=1740665038"},"name":"Demo Gameplay Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107900/f71372bd82533c59f6a529f5a46b17812d6e51ad/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740665038","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107900/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740665038","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107900/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740665038"}}],"name":"PSYCHExFUSE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7-10 32/64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Stan